[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3670943274","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114038#issuecomment-3670943274","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114038","id":3670943274,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7aziYq","user":{"login":"DarioSamo","id":538504,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzODUwNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/538504?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo","html_url":"https://github.com/DarioSamo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarioSamo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-18T15:50:51Z","updated_at":"2025-12-18T15:50:51Z","body":"I implemented what was necessary for omni lights to wrap around correctly on the atlas.\r\n\r\nWhat remains now is mostly up for debate, as merging this would irreversibly change how the shadows look in mobile renderer projects, and adding a toggle for it might be complexity that most users won't deal with.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3670943274/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3673003777","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114038#issuecomment-3673003777","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114038","id":3673003777,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7a7ZcB","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-19T01:12:10Z","updated_at":"2025-12-19T01:12:10Z","body":"Here is a quick comparison. I will make some more comparisons before we decide. \r\n\r\n_Ultra quality shadows before: 44 mspf_\r\n<img width=\"1159\" height=\"661\" alt=\"ULTRA\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4ac8da3b-18c7-4eba-b7d5-21c2a4c7ecf8\" />\r\n\r\n_Ultra quality shadows after: 23 mspf_\r\n<img width=\"1159\" height=\"661\" alt=\"ULTRA-new\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f1586079-d2b3-4d29-a5f6-20f7cfa7efe9\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nImportantly:\r\n1. You can't tell the difference on textured materials since they hide the artifacts in both cases\r\n2. You can't tell the difference unless you are zoomed in extremely close like this\r\n3. The new case doesn't support shadow scale\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3673003777/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3720428648","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114038#issuecomment-3720428648","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114038","id":3720428648,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dwTxo","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T19:29:35Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T19:29:35Z","body":"Discussed in the rendering meeting today. To get this into a mergable state, we should basically allow both paths, switchable with a project setting. \r\n\r\nI.e. add something like `use_fixed_pcf_kernel` (false by default) and `use_fixed_pcf_kernel.mobile` (true by default) so that the fixed kernel is only used by default on actual mobile devices. This maintains compatibility, but makes it so switching to soft shadows becomes feasible on mobile devices and standalone VR","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3720428648/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3756411842","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114038#issuecomment-3756411842","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114038","id":3756411842,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7f5kvC","user":{"login":"KeyboardDanni","id":34800072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODAwMDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34800072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyboardDanni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-15T19:04:06Z","updated_at":"2026-01-15T19:04:06Z","body":"Agreed on making it a project setting, since the Mobile renderer has some use on desktop configs as well (slightly more FPS for games with just basic lighting). Players could have the option to turn it on or off via in-game settings for integrated graphics (which could help, as I noticed my laptop's integrated Radeon has had trouble with high-quality shadowmapping in the past).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3756411842/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3756423229","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114038#issuecomment-3756423229","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114038","id":3756423229,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7f5ng9","user":{"login":"KeyboardDanni","id":34800072,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODAwMDcy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34800072?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni","html_url":"https://github.com/KeyboardDanni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KeyboardDanni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-15T19:07:19Z","updated_at":"2026-01-15T19:08:26Z","body":"> 1. You can't tell the difference on textured materials since they hide the artifacts in both cases\r\n> 2. You can't tell the difference unless you are zoomed in extremely close like this\r\n\r\nCould be an issue for filtered sharp (cel-style) shadows (they'd look a bit blockier). But some trade-offs are to be expected I think.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3756423229/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]